Maxima 5.50-post change log
===========================

Other changes:
--------------
* Share packages that compile their Lisp files on first load (draw,
  lapack, linearalgebra, ...) can be compiled when Maxima is built:
  "make share-binaries" compiles them beside the Lisp image, and
  "make install" installs them there.  Maxima loads such a package
  from there, without compiling or writing anything, unless one of its
  sources is newer; then it compiles the package into maxima_objdir as
  before
